    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8056" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνέβρᾰχε</span></b> , (v. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Βράχω</span>), 3sg.
		aor. 2, with no pres., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ
			δ᾽ ἀνέβραχε</span> but it [the armour] <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>clashed</i> or <i>rang loudly,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				19.13
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ δ᾽ ἀνέβραχεν</span> [the
